// lamps-x.lmc - each lamp copies its switch (extended LMC with the peripherals, NOT part of OCR's LMC)
// The peripherals are memory-mapped: `LDA switch1` reads mailbox 94, and `STA lamp1` writes mailbox 97.
// A switch holds 1 when it is up and 0 when it is down. A lamp is lit while its mailbox holds anything but 0.
// Run it at Medium or Fast (not Instant), then click the switches. Press Pause to stop it.
loop    LDA switch1
        STA lamp1
        LDA switch2
        STA lamp2
        LDA switch3
        STA lamp3
        BRA loop
